WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:04.810
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

00:04.810 --> 00:12.530
Asano hitogomi o nagamete coffee nondeiru
Watching a crowd in the morning, and drinking coffee

00:13.450 --> 00:21.450
Aseri nado naikano youni hitoni wa mieru daro
People must see me as if I don't have any worries

00:22.090 --> 00:29.920
lma menomae ni atomodori dekinai jikan ga
I know that the time I will never be able to get back

00:30.700 --> 00:38.220
Tashika ni nagareteru koto o watashi wa shitteru
Is moving in front of me

00:38.430 --> 00:47.440
Marude kyou shika nai toiu ikikata o shitemita toki
If I live like today is the last day of my life

00:47.720 --> 00:55.490
Saisho ni nani ga mieru darou
I wonder what I can see first

00:56.560 --> 01:00.790
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:01.260 --> 01:09.250
Sore ga donnani chiisana hikari demo ii
I don't care no matter how small the light is

01:09.740 --> 01:11.740
I just wish to see its shape
I just wish to see its shape

01:11.740 --> 01:15.970
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:16.680 --> 01:22.430
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.430 --> 01:22.650
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.650 --> 01:29.150
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
Sonna hito ni deaitai
Who I can tell my honest feelings to

01:29.150 --> 01:30.980
Mermaid Forest
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology

01:37.470 --> 01:41.930
Last Episode
Mermaid's Scar
(Part II)

01:57.350 --> 01:59.340
<i>Ma, try this.</i>

02:00.920 --> 02:02.220
<i>What is it?</i>

02:03.730 --> 02:05.060
<i>Mermaid flesh.</i>

02:05.560 --> 02:07.690
They say it'll give you
eternal youth and immortality.

02:14.070 --> 02:15.300
<i>It's good.</i>

02:15.540 --> 02:17.160
<i>Here, you eat too, Ma.</i>

02:48.100 --> 02:49.400
You're covered in blood.

02:52.370 --> 02:54.740
You must have struggled a lot.

02:56.580 --> 02:57.670
It hurts, doesn't it?

02:57.950 --> 02:58.780
Oops.

03:00.350 --> 03:01.940
You're fierce, aren't you?

03:02.450 --> 03:05.580
Untie me!
I'm going back to Yuta!

03:06.120 --> 03:08.210
I see, then...

03:09.260 --> 03:11.250
I have to bring you Yuta's head.

03:12.960 --> 03:15.230
You won't be able to give up
unless you see it, right?

03:15.500 --> 03:16.860
What the hell...

03:17.000 --> 03:18.490
do you want?!

03:21.640 --> 03:24.970
You're going to live with me
from now on, Mana.

03:25.910 --> 03:26.810
What?

03:36.290 --> 03:37.720
Mana!

03:42.160 --> 03:43.680
Mana!

03:53.270 --> 03:54.240
<i>Mana...</i>

03:55.140 --> 03:56.470
<i>where are you?</i>

04:34.040 --> 04:34.910
Hey.

04:39.150 --> 04:40.170
Not yet?

04:41.320 --> 04:43.080
Haven't you come back to life yet?

04:46.720 --> 04:47.810
Please...

04:48.890 --> 04:52.420
Please tell me where that brat is...

04:56.170 --> 04:57.330
It's no use.

04:58.870 --> 05:00.890
That woman doesn't know anything.

05:03.070 --> 05:07.670
I guess the mermaid flesh
didn't work too well for her.

05:08.210 --> 05:11.740
It takes longer these days
for her to come back to life.

05:12.210 --> 05:16.380
But I have no use
for her anymore...

05:17.120 --> 05:20.710
I'll make sure to cut
her head off later.

05:21.960 --> 05:22.720
You!

05:30.870 --> 05:31.990
Stop right there!

05:34.340 --> 05:35.460
You son of a!

05:52.420 --> 05:53.680
Piano wire?

05:54.290 --> 05:55.620
Too bad.

05:56.630 --> 05:58.060
I guess it's not so easy...

05:58.060 --> 05:59.430
to make a human head roll
from its neck after all.

06:02.100 --> 06:03.390
You son of a!

06:42.040 --> 06:45.130
I stole it during the last war.

06:45.910 --> 06:47.100
It's real.

06:49.510 --> 06:52.540
You're going to do me...

06:54.320 --> 06:55.940
If I let you live...

06:56.020 --> 06:57.610
Mana will run away.

06:58.690 --> 07:00.280
Just like that woman.

07:01.620 --> 07:02.490
So...

07:06.500 --> 07:07.590
Don't screw with me!

07:24.850 --> 07:28.150
I've lived on my own...

07:28.720 --> 07:29.950
for 500 years.

07:32.950 --> 07:34.890
The pain of being alone and...

07:35.520 --> 07:39.190
agony of immortality,
I know through and through.

07:41.100 --> 07:42.560
That's why I can't forgive you!

07:42.830 --> 07:45.660
How many have you fed
the mermaid flesh to?

07:51.310 --> 07:52.800
Then why don't you kill me?

08:10.560 --> 08:12.030
You're too soft.

08:13.130 --> 08:15.060
Maybe you haven't
suffered enough.

08:17.200 --> 08:18.290
You...

08:22.900 --> 08:26.100
I've already lived for
800 years in this form.

08:27.310 --> 08:28.780
800 years...

08:30.710 --> 08:34.380
I've no need of being preached to
by a big ape like you...

08:34.380 --> 08:35.780
who's as green as grass.

08:43.760 --> 08:44.690
Let me see...

08:44.690 --> 08:47.460
who was the first one
I fed mermaid flesh to?

08:57.210 --> 09:02.640
Maybe it was my real mom...

09:03.850 --> 09:05.340
but I don't remember.

09:06.650 --> 09:09.210
You knew that she might
turn into a monster...

09:10.790 --> 09:13.310
and yet you...

09:15.460 --> 09:17.790
I've gotten along on my own
for about 100 years.

09:20.960 --> 09:23.760
Once in a while, there were
people who'd take me in.

09:25.100 --> 09:29.470
But they all died so easily
from war, famine, or epidemic.

09:31.340 --> 09:34.600
Then I remembered
the mermaid flesh.

09:36.780 --> 09:40.650
I thought, why don't I make
someone like me?

09:45.750 --> 09:47.690
I had all the time I needed.

09:48.720 --> 09:50.660
And when I tried,
I did find some.

09:52.290 --> 09:54.290
I tried the mermaid flesh on many.

09:55.330 --> 10:01.500
But that woman lasted
the longest of them all.

10:02.670 --> 10:04.570
She may not appear so now...

10:05.010 --> 10:06.770
but she was nice
in the beginning.

10:08.080 --> 10:09.410
And now...

10:12.350 --> 10:13.710
you did it to Yukie.

10:15.780 --> 10:16.910
The woman...

10:18.350 --> 10:21.290
who was always so kind to you.

10:22.190 --> 10:23.210
<i>Ma'am!</i>

10:24.430 --> 10:26.290
<i>Are you sure you'll be all right?</i>

10:26.600 --> 10:28.460
<i>Would you like me to</i>
<i>stay here for the night?</i>

10:29.560 --> 10:31.830
<i>I feel sorry for the boy</i>
<i>at the mansion, though.</i>

10:32.270 --> 10:34.360
<i>I feel like I'm walking out on him.</i>

10:35.700 --> 10:39.540
<i>Yuta, please keep an eye on him.</i>

10:41.240 --> 10:42.380
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

10:42.380 --> 10:44.470
<i>I wish I could stay</i>
<i>with you longer, but...</i>

10:47.950 --> 10:52.350
Did you truly not care whether
she'd die or turn into a monster?

10:56.020 --> 11:00.290
People like us can't afford to
care for someone every time...

11:02.400 --> 11:04.090
we get to know them.

11:42.370 --> 11:43.000
Hey!

11:46.170 --> 11:48.730
Untie me!
Move it!

11:52.310 --> 11:56.050
<i>I'll make that little punk</i>
<i>pay for this!</i>

12:14.540 --> 12:16.090
Don't move.

12:34.390 --> 12:36.220
I guess I should
let him eat another one.

12:51.210 --> 12:53.000
Are you afraid to die?

12:57.180 --> 12:58.870
Ma...na...

13:08.990 --> 13:13.960
Mermaid Forest

13:13.960 --> 13:18.980
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest

13:29.410 --> 13:30.440
Yuta!

13:35.880 --> 13:36.680
Yuta!

13:37.520 --> 13:39.580
Yuta! Yuta!

13:40.260 --> 13:41.450
You!

13:52.400 --> 13:54.100
Behave yourself.

14:29.600 --> 14:30.730
If you kill him!

14:31.340 --> 14:32.930
If you kill Yuta!

14:34.410 --> 14:36.500
I'll kill you!

14:37.680 --> 14:40.840
I'll spend the rest of my life
chasing you...

14:41.580 --> 14:44.110
and I'll behead you!

14:50.130 --> 14:52.320
If I lose Yuta...

14:53.560 --> 14:56.290
that's all I will do.

15:25.760 --> 15:27.730
A terrible woman.

15:32.830 --> 15:36.860
I've never seen
such a terrible woman.

15:41.680 --> 15:42.270
Hey.

15:47.050 --> 15:51.820
I've decided to let you live
for a while longer.

15:55.590 --> 15:57.180
Wake up!

15:58.160 --> 15:59.020
Hey!

16:08.500 --> 16:11.870
You're really dead.

16:44.110 --> 16:47.370
I still have some mermaid flesh left.

16:48.310 --> 16:49.140
Bye.

16:49.980 --> 16:51.640
I'll see you around
if you're still alive.

16:52.150 --> 16:53.040
Wait!

18:54.870 --> 18:55.670
Mana...

18:57.270 --> 18:58.430
Yuta...

19:06.380 --> 19:07.510
Where is he?

19:09.680 --> 19:11.650
He fled with
the mermaid flesh.

19:13.250 --> 19:14.280
Let's go look for him.

19:38.680 --> 19:42.670
<i>I'll find someone else</i>
<i>when I come back to life.</i>

19:50.220 --> 19:52.820
The lady of the mansion
died in the fire?

19:53.030 --> 19:57.100
Right, and I heard the boy was
playing with the car and...

19:57.100 --> 19:59.290
got into a terrible accident.

20:00.540 --> 20:01.800
What about Yukie?

20:01.800 --> 20:03.670
That helper girl working
at the mansion.

20:05.040 --> 20:07.300
They haven't been
able to find her.

20:07.810 --> 20:09.880
She was probably
spending the night there.

20:09.880 --> 20:11.080
How awful.

20:11.080 --> 20:13.270
She was such a nice girl.

20:24.160 --> 20:25.250
<i>Yukie...</i>

20:30.060 --> 20:31.090
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

20:44.080 --> 20:44.980
Hey, Mana.

20:46.910 --> 20:49.080
You were crying...

20:49.080 --> 20:51.450
when I came back to life.

20:54.590 --> 20:55.650
Were you afraid?

20:56.420 --> 20:57.480
Don't be stupid.

20:59.330 --> 21:00.820
It's just that...

21:01.430 --> 21:03.020
I'd never seen
you cry before that.

21:03.700 --> 21:06.360
Yeah, I cried for the first time.

21:08.070 --> 21:10.830
Once I knew you were alive...

21:11.510 --> 21:14.480
I was so happy that
tears came to my eyes.

21:19.410 --> 21:20.610
I wonder why, though.

21:21.680 --> 21:23.080
I was happy, you know.

21:26.050 --> 21:27.180
I think...

21:27.760 --> 21:31.920
it must mean that
you've got a crush on me.

21:37.700 --> 21:39.360
What does
"have a crush on" mean?

21:40.270 --> 21:41.170
Never mind.

22:25.050 --> 22:33.540
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

22:34.920 --> 22:43.420
ltsumade kakaruno to anata wa warau kedo
"How long does it take?" You smiled at me

22:44.870 --> 22:53.760
Dorekurai oboete iru hidoku naki nagara
How much do you remember? I cried hard

22:54.810 --> 23:04.320
Dorekurai oboete iru anokoto to ieba
How much do you remember if I talk about "that thing"?

23:09.390 --> 23:18.410
ltsumademo mada utsumuite
I still look down

23:19.370 --> 23:27.880
Tobikoe rarenai mizutamari
I can't jump over the puddle

23:29.010 --> 23:38.540
Wakaranakunaru moshikasuruto
I'm confused

23:38.850 --> 23:48.350
Kawarenai no wa watashi dake kana
Maybe I'm the only one who still can't change

23:53.320 --> 24:02.880
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it
